            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Margine is for informational purposes only — it's not financial advice or a bookmaker. Odds shown may change at the bookmaker before your bet is confirmed, and betting may be restricted depending on your jurisdiction — check local regulations before using any bookmaker."
